                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "625ba081-a8cf-398c-9dd0-a24e496b9066",
                                        "entry_id": "16335fb3-0d2a-30a8-9bd5-19a7bf41b5e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any hue or color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "dye",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "034e3b6f-c8ba-3555-9454-cb0ea23891df",
                                        "entry_id": "ca6097a4-5183-32a9-867e-1f1f3c18229c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To colour with dye, or as if with dye."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b371e16-6564-4c66-99f6-64e6156755c6",
                                                "sense_id": "034e3b6f-c8ba-3555-9454-cb0ea23891df",
                                                "text": "You look different. Have you had your hair dyed?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81eaaed8-e541-4bff-b21c-26b2c98891c3",
                                                "sense_id": "034e3b6f-c8ba-3555-9454-cb0ea23891df",
                                                "text": "But tho’ Black cannot be Dyed to the laſt perfection either in Wool or Hair without Woad, the Hatters have quite left off their accuſtomed uſe of it in the Dying of Hatts, and believe at the ſame time, that too ſtrong a Black makes the Hairs or Nap fall off, which is very neceſſary for the ſale and beauty of the Hatts, though this rather proceeds from the hand of the Workman that dreſſes them than in Dying them, or the Hairs not being ſufficiently fulled, or ſtrongly enough united to the felt; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ad1a120-517f-4ebb-bae3-dcf89633ce7e",
                                                "sense_id": "034e3b6f-c8ba-3555-9454-cb0ea23891df",
                                                "text": "If indeed sharks were inclined to eat people, the world's oceans would be dyed crimson with the blood of millions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a91547b-d7d5-4c04-a08b-f217911cd579",
                                                "sense_id": "034e3b6f-c8ba-3555-9454-cb0ea23891df",
                                                "text": "I found this 4-500 Mesh Nylon Strainer Flour Sieve handy and budget-friendly, especially for those who dye often and want to keep solids out of their pots effortlessly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "dye",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4397266-02a1-3071-b3a3-4706eaf5acd9",
                                        "entry_id": "38871b2a-241e-3c98-9f0f-3d9362321276",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Archaic spelling of die (“a cube used in games of chance”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44736288-701c-45a9-9265-f95c79ca0247",
                                                "sense_id": "d4397266-02a1-3071-b3a3-4706eaf5acd9",
                                                "text": "The Superficies was compoſed of ſeveral bits of Wood, about the bigneſs of a Dye, but ſome larger than others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcea84c8-d321-438b-81df-5a53b06a37ab",
                                                "sense_id": "d4397266-02a1-3071-b3a3-4706eaf5acd9",
                                                "text": "If a dye were marked with one figure or number of spots on four sides, and with another figure or number of spots on the two remaining sides, it would be more probable, that the former would turn up than the latter;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e1ddbd1d-bf75-454b-aefd-d53718f72e27",
                        "source_entry_id": "2dbe2aa6-88ff-322a-9f76-c1a06f9b5b13",
                        "source_sense_id": "262db037-e0c5-3693-983e-8de8f2ae2467",
                        "source_sense_description": "stof waarmee men iets kleurt",
                        "target_lang_word": "colorant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "colorant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "286a2a77-8545-3cd8-b09c-514160cc1d8c",
                                        "entry_id": "23f2f1ac-21f3-3f07-a9ef-546a9352df0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui colore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad6d3cf7-7f94-4dc0-b4fb-ca493bbc744d",
                                                "sense_id": "286a2a77-8545-3cd8-b09c-514160cc1d8c",
                                                "text": "D’après MM. Pelletier et Caventou, le carmin est un composé de la matière colorante de la cochenille, d’une matière animale qui y est également renfermée […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "662f3ee8-d6c3-4ee5-92af-81d52c051cdb",
                                                "sense_id": "286a2a77-8545-3cd8-b09c-514160cc1d8c",
                                                "text": "Ainsi le brun se retrouve avec tous ses éléments colorants, du rouge le plus vif au noir de velours, dans les taupins, les altises, les pyrochres, les coccinelles, et dans les papillons, les sphinx, les bombyx, les noctuelles, les sésies ; le gris végétal dans les couleurs jaunes, vertes, bleues, métalliques et brillantes des capricornes, des pucerons, des tettigones, des buprestes, des chrysomèles, des punaises, des orchestes, des stencores qui font leur séjour sur ces arbustes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "816f6de8-c4fd-4251-8be2-2b4d5c8094e6",
                                                "sense_id": "286a2a77-8545-3cd8-b09c-514160cc1d8c",
                                                "text": "À l’acide azoteux AzO₂H correspondent les azotites utilisés (sels de sodium, de potassium) dans l’industrie des matières colorantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "091abb5f-4c76-4002-bf1c-ace926a14e9f",
                                                "sense_id": "286a2a77-8545-3cd8-b09c-514160cc1d8c",
                                                "text": "Les mouliniers, dans la région lyonnaise, emploient des produits colorants, bleu, vert, rouge, etc., qui sont destinés à distinguer les torsions, notamment pour les crêpes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "colorant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "886ab485-e12d-38e0-becb-bddda4587873",
                                        "entry_id": "6672116a-6e30-3082-81b2-cecef287e88c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Substance qui colore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb5d6074-3dc4-4e89-a31e-f79af7f47759",
                                                "sense_id": "886ab485-e12d-38e0-becb-bddda4587873",
                                                "text": "Les pois égouttés doivent présenter la couleur normale caractéristique des pois secs trempés en conserve, compte tenu de toute adjonction de colorants artificiels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ddc8037-e249-4c15-9ce1-9669755638f1",
                                                "sense_id": "886ab485-e12d-38e0-becb-bddda4587873",
                                                "text": "Le jaune Lucifer (Lucifer yellow = colorant fluorescent à base de luciférine) et la péroxydase (par exemple, la péroxydase du Raifort ou péroxydase du radis de cheval = la HRP pour horse radish peroxydase) qui est une enzyme pouvant être incorporée non spécifiquement par les cellules."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6753f12f-c552-4873-ac93-4021f42c2139",
                                                "sense_id": "886ab485-e12d-38e0-becb-bddda4587873",
                                                "text": "Encore un truc made in China, avec des colorants polluants, importés en cargos, pour un événement climaticide complètement inutile en plein effondrement climatique, se désole Marie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "colorant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4edcbaa4-efc1-32af-95ac-42b00e28780c",
                                        "entry_id": "ced5f5b0-4301-3252-8178-cae3b6ba6a14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Participe présent du verbe colorer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f39549c-c624-43fb-9825-51a1b7b487c3",
                                                "sense_id": "4edcbaa4-efc1-32af-95ac-42b00e28780c",
                                                "text": "La Twingo blanche était en effet sagement arrêtée à un feu. Ses lumières de frein colorant le panache de gaz d’échappement d’un rouge sang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
